                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "38985581",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198115497313",
                            "num_reviews": 88,
                            "playtime_forever": 127,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 89,
                            "last_played": 1550296315
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I knew the second I saw this game it would be fun. The graphics are a cool retro style. The gameplay is really good. You pick what nation you are, you have a huge map that you must take over all the other nations. Each nation has its own theme and colors which keeps it fresh. \n\nOn some of the harder nations you really have to manage your troops and what equipment you give them, to defend your base and destroy the enemys base. The system this game has in place for selecting what troop type and the equipment they get is really good. You really feel like the boss in control of your nations fate.\n\nOverall its a fun game with a really cool theme, I can't wait to see what future update bring to Souland!!!",
